  <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Material changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

  <h2><span class="num">11</span>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:ops@keresai.com" style="color:var(--orange)">ops@keresai.com</a>.</p>
